---
title: Google sync, both ways with last write wins - Activity Diagram
---
flowchart TD
    START(["Sync now<br/>one account"]):::terminal
    START --> LIST["Read from Google<br/>events / tasks changed since the last sync<br/>(a full pass once a day)"]
    LIST --> EACH[For each returned item]

    EACH --> KNOWN{"Imported before?"}
    KNOWN -- No --> CREATE["Create the item from Google<br/>store the fingerprint of Google's values"]
    KNOWN -- Yes --> DELETED{"Deleted in Google?"}
    DELETED -- Yes --> CANCEL["Cancel the item, forget the waiting edit<br/>a deletion in Google always wins"]
    DELETED -- No --> CHANGED{"Google's values differ from<br/>the stored fingerprint?"}

    CHANGED -- No --> NEXT
    CHANGED -- Yes --> WAITING{"Edit made in the app<br/>waiting to be sent?"}
    WAITING -- No --> TAKE["Take Google's version"]
    WAITING -- Yes --> LATER{"Google's updated time later than<br/>the time of the edit in the app?"}
    LATER -- Yes --> REPLACE["Google's version replaces the edit<br/>the waiting edit is forgotten"]
    LATER -- No --> KEEP["Keep the fields edited in the app<br/>take the other fields from Google"]

    CREATE --> NEXT
    CANCEL --> NEXT
    TAKE --> NEXT
    REPLACE --> NEXT
    KEEP --> NEXT
    NEXT{More items?}
    NEXT -- Yes --> EACH
    NEXT -- No --> SEND

    SEND["Items with an edit waiting<br/>(also those Google did not return: unchanged there)"]
    SEND --> ALLOWED{"Account allowed PlanFlow<br/>to change its data?"}
    ALLOWED -- No --> HOLD["Edits wait until the user reconnects"]
    ALLOWED -- Yes --> READ["Read the item from Google if it was not returned<br/>build the patch: only the edited fields<br/>that differ from Google, [planflow] line kept"]
    READ --> PATCH["PATCH, guests are not notified"]
    PATCH --> ANSWER{Google's answer}
    ANSWER -- accepted --> DONE["Fingerprints taken from Google's answer<br/>edit no longer waits"]
    ANSWER -- item gone --> GONE["Cancel the item"]
    ANSWER -- refused --> LOCAL["The edit stays in the app only"]
    ANSWER -- temporary failure --> RETRY["The edit waits for the next sync"]

    HOLD --> FIN
    DONE --> FIN
    GONE --> FIN
    LOCAL --> FIN
    RETRY --> FIN
    FIN(["Save, rescore the team"]):::terminal

    classDef terminal fill:#1d4ed8,stroke:#1d4ed8,color:#fff
